<p>The feed is live at <a href="/feed.xml"><code>/feed.xml</code></a>. Current entries, pulled straight from the <code>posts</code> collection:</p>
<ul class="demo__live-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    — <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
